{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1019.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"fe228b541748d2870ad53ade7a34b8017a0d9debfb4368022e0f0320c680a9c8","ja":"聖母の戦い！！","zh":"圣母之战！！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1019.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"33cc4df1463be1967463ad3b380d464e2a113405f61f82432406addd77893493","ja":"みなさん～、番組、楽しんでいただけてますか～？\n『劇場ゲーム部』、最後も生放送でお送りします～。","zh":"各位～，节目看得到还开心吗～？\n《剧场游戏部》最后一期也将以直播的形式呈现哦～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1019.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"a251c00eee1b9e3028e84210670034d45a03128243b04303391972a353471eb8","ja":"FPSというジャンルのゲーム、『2ndクロス』に\n挑戦しますよ～。ではさっそく始めましょう～！","zh":"我要挑战FPS类型的游戏——《2nd交叉》哦～。\n那么就马上开始吧～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1019.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7f8bbb5bc249de0ac12a5f84753aa5f143f67d79048178d3496e692f9da518b2","ja":"1時間後……","zh":"一个小时后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1019.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f362dcab6cbb8cb0514ae9e760cd2a0dcc7583a69ea4b8821a13d96d3af79453","ja":"ドンッ！　ドンッ！　ドンッ！","zh":"咚！　咚！　咚！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1019.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"86fc68772db93a62d97aee455d3931fd6762874e8c8b98a8876b13bf83a463e7","ja":"なるほど～……。\n基本的な操作は、できるようになりました～。","zh":"原来如此～……\n基本的的操作，已经学会了～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1019.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"6e59d8c3c1c00dff49cd41a0d24c6f80e6846da0244785c9c1641946c74be6aa","ja":"このままステージを進めてもいいのですが……\nこのゲームは協力プレイができるそうですね～？","zh":"虽然直接继续推进关卡也可以……\n不过听说这款游戏可以合作游玩呢～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1019.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"2b14a08d3e3872e946dfdc0ac0405d241a1cf51a2a381ca19ea1da339012d378","ja":"せっかくですから、私を手助けしてくれる方を\n番組内で募集します～。","zh":"难得有这个机会，就在节目里\n招募来协助我的人吧～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1019.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"af6fcf6d98aee47ed14f5efd0a1129216fe541869c2321dc5f0ec7ece06e25ac","ja":"聖母と共に戦う決意を固めた子豚ちゃんは、\nフレンド申請をお願いしますね～♪","zh":"已经下定决心与圣母一同战斗的小猪仔们，\n就请申请好友吧～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1019.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"25793089ad2bba97b8ac9375df763fd19c4d12134fe2e2620571b3ffab93cd43","ja":"さらに1時間後……","zh":"又过了1小时……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1019.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"626429b7dc4180eda65f20249856ebfcde68a4ff7234fc1b7f0e01c4fdcc155e","ja":"……さて、そろそろ終了の時間ですので、\n協力プレイを終わりにしますね～。","zh":"……那么，时间也差不多到了，\n协力游玩就到此结束啦～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1019.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"2779615ac8452b506f3a3dbc409eca40969069fecd0e78d46a4e5ae105909583","ja":"みなさんの献身的な戦いのおかげで、一度もダメージを\n受けることなくプレイすることができました～。","zh":"多亏了大家的无私奋战，才能在完全没有受到\n任何伤害的情况下通关了～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1019.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"40c0d707febce20bd1a431aa93a568410cf19012d695ffb94b849b7f59551c03","ja":"それにフレンド申請も、\n予想していなかった数があったそうで～。","zh":"而且好友申请的数量，\n似乎也超出了预期呢～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1019.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"d4141bf2e5a7f00fec4e9faa11be8e8e00b73789689f3c1147766b9f7bc79914","ja":"その忠誠に報いるためにも、\nまたこのような機会を用意したいと思います～。","zh":"为了回报这份忠诚，\n我也会想再准备这样的机会的～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1019.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"99386d63a19d68a2dac601b841c7f94830efe814b86740aa2ea2e6956db8c34d","ja":"そのときはまた、共に戦いましょう～！","zh":"到那时再一起并肩作战吧～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
